* DFHJCT: hand-written fixture (#5154), syntax per IBM CICS TS for VSE/ESA R1 Resource Definition Guide
* SC33-1653-05 ch.29 Table 41 p.270-272 (TYPE=ENTRY,JFILEID={SYSTEM|nn},JTYPE={TAPE1|TAPE2|DISK1|DISK2|SMF},BUFSIZE=).
DFHJCT   CSECT
         DFHJCT TYPE=INITIAL,SUFFIX=01
         DFHJCT TYPE=ENTRY,JFILEID=SYSTEM,JTYPE=DISK2,BUFSIZE=6000
         DFHJCT TYPE=ENTRY,JFILEID=03,JTYPE=TAPE1,BUFSIZE=4096
         DFHJCT TYPE=FINAL
         END
